  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advice on results framework, center for support   and development of civic initiatives -Resonance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xE5;dgivning om resultatramverk, Center f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d ochutveckling av civila initiativ -Resonance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har mottagit ett projektf&#xF6;rslag fr&#xE5;n den tranisnistriska NGO:n Resonance. F&#xF6;rslaget indikerar att Resonance beh&#xF6;ver st&#xF6;d inom &quot;Result Based Management&quot;. Sida har beslutat att erbjuda extern experthj&#xE4;lp f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra Resonances resultatramverk genom att utveckla mer realistiska och kontrollerbara m&#xE5;l samt st&#xE4;rka deras f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga att f&#xF6;lja upp och uppn&#xE5; resultat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has received a draft proposal from the Tranistrian NGO Resonance and the proposal indicates that Resonance is in need of support in the area of Result Based Management. Sida has decided to offer external expert advice to improve Resonance&#xB4;s results framework by developing more realistic and monitorable objectives and to  strengthen their ability to follow up and achieve results.</narrative>
  </description>
